{"date": "2026-11-01", "word": "Flat", "summary": "A flat day (forecast flat). Thermals were strongest (moderate) about 15:00. The upslope ran from about 08:30 to about 16:30. The evening before, the page called it low, about 4,100 ft, a miss. Midday the base averaged about 4,800 ft by the Kekoa camera, 700 ft higher than the evening's number; the morning update said about 3,900 ft, off by 900 ft. Most of the day the shear line was crossing Kula Highway near Omaopio; furthest south about 17:37, crossing Kula Highway near Waiakoa. Data gaps: Upper Kahikinui stopped at 13:35; Kahikinui stopped at 13:40; Nakula stopped at 15:15; the Mesonet could not be reached on 25 of 68 updates.", "therm": "<strong>Flat</strong> for the day, 10:00\u201314:00<div class=\"sub\">Kula Ag's measured air through the NAM sounding (thermal.py); forecast was Flat</div>", "base": "", "notes": ["Saturated morning after the rain earlier in the week: low cloud until about 09:00.", "The cloud decayed from the base up from about 15:00.", "Watched for: Base will lift (P3) from 07:40; Late-day decay (P7) from 15:07."], "chart": "<div class=\"watch\"><div class=\"kind\">What the day did</div><ul><li>Saturated morning after the rain earlier in the week: low cloud until about 09:00.</li><li>The cloud decayed from the base up from about 15:00.</li><li>Watched for: Base will lift (P3) from 07:40; Late-day decay (P7) from 15:07.</li></ul></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;margin:10px 0 2px\">Cloudbase</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted,#6b6b66);margin:2px 0 4px\">\n<span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;border-top:2px dashed #8a5cd6;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Forecast (sounding)</span>\n<span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;background:#2a78d6;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Derived (stations)</span><span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#3f9d5a;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Kekoa camera</span><span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#e0a100;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Camera hidden (cloud or rain)</span><span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid #898781;box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Camera, no call</span></div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;min-width:0;height:220px\"><canvas id=\"basechart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Derived cloudbase through the day\"></canvas></div>\n<div class=\"sub\">Derived from the stations every 15 minutes during the upslope. Forecast: the RRFS Kahului sounding (run 01 12Z), its air at Kula Ag&#x27;s height lifted to condensation, hour by hour.</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var d = {\"derived\": [[540, 3570.0], [555, 3280.0], [570, 2960.0], [585, 2980.0], [600, 3330.0], [615, 3520.0], [630, 3560.0], [645, 3540.0], [660, 3680.0], [675, 3700.0], [690, 3650.0], [705, 3490.0], [720, 3870.0], [735, 3930.0], [750, 3880.0], [765, 3960.0], [780, 4490.0], [795, 4520.0], [810, 4460.0], [825, 4610.0], [840, 4160.0], [855, 4100.0], [870, 3900.0], [885, 3920.0], [900, 4030.0], [915, 4200.0], [930, 3900.0], [945, 3900.0], [960, 3890.0]], \"forecast\": [], \"camera\": [[567, 2610.0], [576, 2860.0], [585, 3130.0], [593, 3000.0], [601, 3340.0], [610, 3870.0], [618, 4250.0], [627, 4700.0], [636, 4940.0], [645, 4930.0], [654, 4400.0], [662, 4110.0], [679, 3530.0], [688, 3470.0], [696, 3600.0], [705, 3810.0], [713, 3640.0], [722, 3530.0], [731, 3570.0], [739, 5210.0], [747, 5220.0], [756, 5610.0], [765, 5780.0], [773, 5040.0], [782, 5240.0], [790, 5580.0], [799, 5730.0], [807, 5600.0], [824, 6400.0], [833, 6860.0], [850, 3430.0], [859, 4110.0], [868, 4830.0], [894, 5070.0], [902, 5210.0], [911, 5600.0], [919, 5910.0], [928, 6110.0], [936, 6550.0], [945, 6020.0], [954, 5800.0]], \"hidden\": [542, 551, 559], \"proj\": [[540, 3700.0], [600, 3500.0], [660, 3450.0], [720, 3580.0], [780, 4660.0], [840, 4980.0], [900, 3580.0], [960, 3780.0]], \"nocall\": [671, 816, 842, 876], \"up\": [540, 960], \"nocu\": null}, pt = function (a) { return {x: a[0], y: a[1]}; };\n  var dark = matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches, muted = '#898781', grid = dark ? '#2c2c2a' : '#e1e0d9';\n  var nocu = { id: 'nocu', beforeDatasetsDraw: function (c) { if (!d.nocu) return; var x = c.scales.x, a = c.chartArea, g = c.ctx,\n    x0 = x.getPixelForValue(d.nocu[0]), x1 = x.getPixelForValue(d.nocu[1]);\n    g.save(); g.fillStyle = 'rgba(137,135,129,0.10)'; g.fillRect(x0, a.top, x1 - x0, a.bottom - a.top);\n    g.fillStyle = muted; g.font = '11px sans-serif'; g.textAlign = 'center';\n    g.fillText('No cumulus', (x0 + x1) / 2, a.top + (a.bottom - a.top) / 2); g.restore(); } };\n  var band = { id: 'band', beforeDatasetsDraw: function (c) { if (!d.up) return; var x = c.scales.x, a = c.chartArea, g = c.ctx;\n    g.save(); g.fillStyle = 'rgba(137,135,129,0.14)';\n    g.fillRect(x.getPixelForValue(d.up[0]), a.top, x.getPixelForValue(d.up[1]) - x.getPixelForValue(d.up[0]), a.bottom - a.top); g.restore(); } };\n  // Landmarks on the slope (Sam, 10-31): dashed lines across the chart.\n  var marks = { id: 'marks', beforeDatasetsDraw: function (c) { var y = c.scales.y, a = c.chartArea, g = c.ctx;\n    [[4600, 'Treeline'], [6200, 'Ferns']].forEach(function (m) {\n      if (m[0] < y.min || m[0] > y.max) return; var py = y.getPixelForValue(m[0]);\n      g.save(); g.strokeStyle = muted; g.lineWidth = 1; g.setLineDash([4, 4]);\n      g.beginPath(); g.moveTo(a.left, py); g.lineTo(a.right, py); g.stroke();\n      g.setLineDash([]); g.fillStyle = muted; g.font = '11px sans-serif'; g.textAlign = 'right';\n      g.fillText(m[1], a.right - 4, py - 4); g.restore(); }); } };\n  var hm = function (m) { return String(Math.floor(m / 60)).padStart(2, '0') + ':' + String(m % 60).padStart(2, '0'); };\n  var ys = d.derived.map(function (a) { return a[1]; }).concat(d.forecast.map(function (a) { return a[1]; })).concat(d.camera.map(function (a) { return a[1]; })).concat(d.proj.map(function (a) { return a[1]; }));\n  var xs = [540, 960];\n  var ymin = Math.min(3500, Math.floor(Math.min.apply(null, ys) / 500) * 500);\n  new Chart(document.getElementById('basechart'), {\n    type: 'line',\n    data: { datasets: [\n      { label: 'Derived', data: d.derived.map(pt), borderColor: '#2a78d6', borderWidth: 2, pointRadius: 0, tension: 0.3 },\n      { label: 'Forecast', data: d.forecast.map(pt), borderColor: '#eb6834', borderWidth: 2, borderDash: [6, 4], pointRadius: 3, pointBackgroundColor: '#eb6834', tension: 0.3 },\n      { label: 'Forecast (sounding)', data: d.proj.map(pt), borderColor: '#8a5cd6', borderWidth: 2, borderDash: [3, 4], pointRadius: 0, tension: 0.3 },\n      { label: 'Kekoa camera', data: d.camera.map(pt), showLine: false, pointRadius: 3, pointBackgroundColor: '#3f9d5a', borderColor: '#3f9d5a' },\n      { label: 'Camera hidden', data: d.hidden.map(function (m) { return {x: m, y: ymin}; }), showLine: false, clip: false,\n         pointRadius: 3, pointBackgroundColor: '#e0a100', borderColor: '#e0a100' },\n      { label: 'Camera, no call', data: d.nocall.map(function (m) { return {x: m, y: ymin}; }), showLine: false, clip: false,\n         pointRadius: 3, pointBorderWidth: 1.5, pointBackgroundColor: 'rgba(0,0,0,0)', borderColor: muted }\n    ] },\n    options: { responsive: true, maintainAspectRatio: false, interaction: { mode: 'nearest', axis: 'x', intersect: false },\n      plugins: { legend: { display: false }, tooltip: { callbacks: {\n        title: function (i) { return hm(i[0].parsed.x); },\n        label: function (i) { return i.dataset.label === 'Camera hidden' ? 'Camera hidden: cloud or rain at the camera'\n          : i.dataset.label === 'Camera, no call' ? 'Camera: no call'\n          : i.dataset.label + ': ' + Math.round(i.parsed.y).toLocaleString() + ' ft'; } } } },\n      scales: {\n        x: { type: 'linear', min: xs[0], max: xs[1], ticks: { stepSize: 60, color: muted, callback: function (v) { return hm(v); } }, grid: { display: false } },\n        y: { min: ymin,\n              max: Math.max(7000, Math.ceil(Math.max.apply(null, ys) / 500) * 500),\n              ticks: { stepSize: 500, color: muted, callback: function (v) { return v.toLocaleString(); } }, grid: { color: grid } }\n      } },\n    plugins: [nocu, marks]\n  });\n})();\n</script>", "line": "Crossing Kula Highway near Omaopio<div class=\"sub\">Most of the day, 15 updates. Furthest south about 17:37: Crossing Kula Highway near Waiakoa</div>", "up": "<span class=\"num\">08:30</span> to about <span class=\"num\">16:30</span>", "wind": "<span class=\"num\">5 mph</span>, gusts to 18<div class=\"sub\">Lower elevations, during the upslope</div>"}